LICENSE and applies to this code.

The upstream repository, https://github.com/NotHarshhaa/mainframe-mcp-server,
was removed from GitHub and returns HTTP 404. The npm package remains published.
Because no release ever shipped a `src/` directory, and the published source
maps contain mappings but no `sourcesContent`, the original TypeScript was not
recoverable directly. These sources were reconstructed by merging the compiled
`dist/*.js` with the `dist/*.d.ts` type declarations that shipped alongside it.

See RECONSTRUCTION.md for the method, verification, and the specific points
where this code intentionally differs from upstream.
